  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/more-cartography-tables.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Cartography-Tables\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h1>更多製圖桌</h1>\n<p>現在每種木材都有專屬的製圖桌，讓你的建築充滿繽紛的製圖樂趣。</p>\n<h5><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Cartography-Tables/pres/cf_desc_banner.webp\" alt=\"\"></h5>\n<p>來自沙漠村落的製圖師站在他的 12 種製圖桌變體收藏前，每個上方都掛著配套的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-torch-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多火把變體</a>。</p>\n<h2>為 Minecraft 新增 11 種新的製圖桌。</h2>\n<hr>\n<h1>與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a> 1.3.0+ 的方塊替換功能相容：</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/szt4z.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n從製圖師的房屋望向沙漠村莊的農場：我們可以看到，遊戲現在生成村莊時，不再使用<em>深色橡木製圖桌</em>、<em>橡木火把</em>和一般的<em>堆肥桶</em>，而是改為<em><strong>叢林木製圖桌</strong></em>、<em><strong>叢林木火把</strong></em>（來自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-torch-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多火把變體</a>）以及<em><strong>叢林木堆肥桶</strong></em>（來自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-composter-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多堆肥桶變體</a>）。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
